    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I've got a heifer that just had a rumenotomy done yesterday morning. I'm a bit worried about how she's going to bounce back. Can you give me a list of what I should be looking out for regarding the incision site and the internal recovery? Also, what should I be doing with her feed for the first few days? Thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
